  "title": "Speed Upgrade",
  "recipes": true,
  "text": [
    "Right-click while holding to open both core slots. Installed cores appear beneath the arrows and can be retrieved. Logistics multiplier = 2 + left bonus + right bonus. Empty slots add zero. Maximum: ×8.",
